    ^{:line 117 :tag bool :doc "Console grants the process the box's console (§5.3, KS10): its stdout and stderr are the\nkernel's own (forwarded to the monitor as the kernel's Write and Message) besides captured,\nits stdin is the box's (the waits and reads forwarded), and the terminal's calls (HostInit,\nSuspend, the tty's) are made on its behalf. Without it stdout and stderr are only captured,\nstdin is at its end, and the terminal's calls are refused (KS14).\n"} Console))




